{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"safee07255cad1aa0","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1dad6ef53fcf73fe65d4","text":"万物は一に始まり、一が二を生み、二が三を生む。太陽は父、月は母。父母が健在であれば、遠くへ旅するべきではないひら……","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-4d1bb44ce0e48bba2fae","text":"こうすれば無知の暗闇から遠ざかれるひら～","speaker":""}]}
